A bordered box that displays a user's badges in a wrapping row, rendered by {{T|Badges}}. Used on user pages.

==Syntax==
{{T|BadgeBox|v1=title =}}

{| class="dataTable sortable"
! Parameter !! Aliases !! Label !! Description !! Type !! Default !! Status
|-
| <code>title</code> || – || Title || Label shown to the left of the badges. || string || Badges: ||
|}

